---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Projects — GeoSmart" description="Selected geology projects by Camila Fernández, covering geophysics, sedimentology, GIS and subsurface thinking.">
  <section class="page-hero projects-hero">
    <div class="projects-topo" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-kicker">Selected work</div>
      <h1>Projects</h1>
      <p class="muted">A growing portfolio of university work and geological problem-solving — from observations and maps to geophysical interpretation and subsurface thinking.</p>
      <div class="hero-rule" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section projects-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="projects-intro"><span class="projects-count">03</span><p>Areas of work · documents and figures coming as the portfolio grows</p></div>
      <div class="projects-grid">
        <article class="card project-card project-seismic">
          <div class="card-image seismic-card"><span>01 / GEOPHYSICS</span><i>⌁</i><b>SEISMIC</b></div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="card-tag">Geophysics · Seismic</div>
            <h3>Seismic Interpretation</h3>
            <p>Work focused on reading seismic evidence as geological information: recognising reflections and structures, building interpretations and thinking carefully about uncertainty.</p>
            <p class="muted"><strong>Coming next:</strong> selected coursework, interpretation figures and the final report.</p>
            <div class="project-line"><span>01</span><span>SUBSURFACE</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card project-card project-sediment">
          <div class="card-image sediment-card"><span>02 / SEDIMENTOLOGY</span><i>≋</i><b>LAYERS</b></div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="card-tag">Sedimentology</div>
            <h3>Sedimentary Environments</h3>
            <p>Coursework connecting sedimentary structures, textures and observations with the environments in which sediments are deposited.</p>
            <p class="muted"><strong>Coming next:</strong> logs, reports, field observations and interpretation work.</p>
            <div class="project-line"><span>02</span><span>EARTH HISTORY</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card project-card project-gis">
          <div class="card-image gis-card"><span>03 / MAPPING</span><i>＋</i><b>FIELD MAP</b></div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="card-tag">GIS · Field Geology</div>
            <h3>Geological Mapping</h3>
            <p>Maps and spatial data used alongside geological reasoning — turning observations and information into a coherent picture of an area.</p>
            <p class="muted"><strong>Coming next:</strong> maps, figures and selected GIS-based coursework.</p>
            <div class="project-line"><span>03</span><span>SPATIAL THINKING</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-box project-cta">
        <div class="section-kicker">A growing portfolio</div>
        <h2>More work is on its way.</h2>
        <p>I'm adding the actual university projects behind these topics rather than filling the portfolio with generic examples. Each project will show the question, approach, tools, interpretation and what I learned from it.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="../contact/">Want to talk about a project? →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .projects-hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f6efe7 0%,#fffdf9 55%,#edf2eb 100%)}
  .projects-hero::before{content:'01';position:absolute;right:5%;top:12%;color:rgba(15,61,62,.055);font:700 clamp(8rem,20vw,18rem)/1 'Playfair Display',serif;letter-spacing:-.08em}
  .projects-hero::after{content:'';position:absolute;right:-90px;bottom:-120px;width:330px;height:330px;border:2px solid rgba(245,130,32,.2);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 24px rgba(245,130,32,.035),0 0 0 50px rgba(15,61,62,.025)}
  .projects-topo{position:absolute;left:-30px;bottom:18px;width:430px;height:150px;opacity:.24;transform:rotate(-4deg)}
  .projects-topo span{position:absolute;inset:0;border:1px solid var(--green);border-radius:48% 52% 45% 55%;transform:rotate(var(--r)) scale(var(--s));}
  .projects-topo span:nth-child(1){--r:3deg;--s:.98}.projects-topo span:nth-child(2){--r:-2deg;--s:.82}.projects-topo span:nth-child(3){--r:4deg;--s:.65}.projects-topo span:nth-child(4){--r:-4deg;--s:.48}.projects-topo span:nth-child(5){--r:2deg;--s:.3}
  .hero-rule{display:flex;gap:7px;margin-top:34px;align-items:center}.hero-rule span{display:block;height:3px;background:var(--orange)}.hero-rule span:nth-child(1){width:70px}.hero-rule span:nth-child(2){width:18px;opacity:.55}.hero-rule span:nth-child(3){width:7px;opacity:.3}
  .projects-intro{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin:0 0 28px;color:#69706d;font-size:.72rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}.projects-count{color:var(--orange);font:600 2.4rem/1 'Playfair Display',serif}
  .project-card{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-top:4px solid var(--orange);transition:transform .3s ease,box-shadow .3s ease}.project-card:hover{transform:translateY(-7px);box-shadow:0 22px 45px rgba(15,61,62,.14)}
  .project-card:nth-child(2){border-top-color:var(--green)}.project-card:nth-child(3){border-top-color:#b69b55}
  .project-card .card-image{transition:transform .45s ease;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.project-card:hover .card-image{transform:scale(1.035)}
  .project-card .card-image::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(15,61,62,.05),rgba(245,130,32,.12));mix-blend-mode:multiply}.project-card .card-image i{position:absolute;right:18px;top:14px;z-index:2;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font:italic 2rem 'Playfair Display',serif}.project-card .card-image b{position:absolute;right:18px;bottom:12px;z-index:2;color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);font-size:.55rem;letter-spacing:.2em}
  .project-seismic .card-image{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0f3d3e,#245d5a)}.project-sediment .card-image{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#b86f32,#f0b66b)}.project-gis .card-image{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#526c55,#9da77c)}
  .project-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:22px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:#7a807d;font-size:.6rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em}.project-line span:first-child{color:var(--orange)}
  .project-cta{position:relative;overflow:hidden;margin-top:64px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--green-deep),var(--green))}.project-cta::after{content:'GEOSMART';position:absolute;right:-15px;bottom:-28px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.045);font:700 5rem/1 'Montserrat',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em;pointer-events:none}.project-cta::before{content:'✦';position:absolute;right:36px;top:28px;color:rgba(245,130,32,.7);font-size:1.6rem}.project-cta p{max-width:720px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.78)}.project-cta .text-link{position:relative;z-index:1;color:#fff}
  @media (max-width:800px){.projects-hero::before{right:-3%;top:24%;font-size:8rem}.projects-topo{width:270px;opacity:.16}.projects-intro{align-items:flex-start}.project-cta{margin-top:42px}}
</style>